<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Alertmanager on aLong</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/tags/alertmanager/</link><description>Recent content in Alertmanager on aLong</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 04 Dec 2019 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.51ai.vip/tags/alertmanager/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Prometheus告警模板详解</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus%E5%91%8A%E8%AD%A6%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Dec 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus%E5%91%8A%E8%AD%A6%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3/</guid><description>之前配置告警之后,可以发送告警信息.但对于数据具体的结构信息,在模板中数据读取都比较懵.原因是不太清除警报都提供了哪些数据,除了我们设置的信息,还有没有其他的信息.<a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus%E5%91%8A%E8%AD%A6%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3/">阅读全文 →</a></description></item><item><title>Prometheus-AlertManager警告管理搭建与配置</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus-alertmanager%E8%AD%A6%E5%91%8A%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%8E%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/</link><pubDate>Sat, 19 Oct 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus-alertmanager%E8%AD%A6%E5%91%8A%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%8E%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/</guid><description>通过翻译官方文档可以了解到,AlertManager是负责为Prometheus(本身不会发送警报)发送警报的工具. AlertManager不是简单发送警报,可以消除重复警报,分组,抑制警报功能.并支持多接收器.<a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus-alertmanager%E8%AD%A6%E5%91%8A%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%8E%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/">阅读全文 →</a></description></item></channel></rss>